" class="sc-hYmYN kkqxkW pf-80_"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-81_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-82_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0614/1470/3297/files/Frame_2276.svg?v=1689926619" width="400" height="400" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fulBNO bzoLbm pf-83_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-84_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-85_">Irritation</h3><p class="sc-bVVHAX cfQUSW pf-87_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you find your eyes, nose and throat to be constantly irritated, you could be victim to VOCs. <br><br>Symptoms include watery or red eyes, runny nose and itchy throat.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-hYmYN kkqxkW pf-89_"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-90_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-91_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0614/1470/3297/files/Frame_2274.svg?v=1689927443" width="400" height="400" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fulBNO bzoLbm pf-92_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-93_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-94_">Asthma &amp; allergies</h3><p class="sc-bVVHAX cfQUSW pf-96_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">For pregnant women exposed to air pollution, it increases the risk of asthma development and eczema in their children. <br><br>For children, high exposure early in life contributes to the development of childhood asthma.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-hYmYN kkqxkW pf-98_"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-99_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-100_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0614/1470/3297/files/Frame_2275.svg?v=1689926629" width="400" height="400" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fulBNO bzoLbm pf-101_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-102_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-103_">Cognitive issues<br></h3><p class="sc-bVVHAX cfQUSW pf-105_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Formaldehyde inhalation can impair brain cell metabolism and slow cellular development. This affects our cognitive function causing us to lose focus quickly, experience headaches, and experience anxiety. More seriously, exposure can affect our motor function, leading to learning and memory disorders.<br><br> Formaldehyde is also a known carcinogen.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-hYmYN kkqxkW pf-107_"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-108_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-109_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0614/1470/3297/files/Frame_2275.svg?v=1689926629" width="400" height="400" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fulBNO bzoLbm pf-110_"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-111_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-112_">Cognitive issues<br></h3><p class="sc-bVVHAX cfQUSW pf-114_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Timeless and modular finishes.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-116_ pf-r pf-r-eh pf-lg-hide" 